---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="bg-ink text-paper">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-site gap-10 px-5 py-14 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr] lg:px-10">
    <div>
      <p class="font-display text-3xl tracking-[0.18em]">BAUHU</p>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-paper/70">Architectural residences and modular building systems for remote, coastal and hurricane exposed sites.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="text-sm leading-8 text-paper/75">
      <p class="eyebrow text-paper">Explore</p>
      <a class="block hover:text-white" href="/residences">Private Residences</a>
      <a class="block hover:text-white" href="/models">Model Based Homes</a>
      <a class="block hover:text-white" href="/projects">Projects</a>
      <a class="block hover:text-white" href="/engineering">Engineering</a>
    </div>
    <div class="text-sm leading-8 text-paper/75">
      <p class="eyebrow text-paper">Begin</p>
      <a class="block hover:text-white" href="/start-your-project">Send us your site details</a>
      <a class="block hover:text-white" href="/resources">Resources</a>
      <a class="block hover:text-white" href="/how-it-works">How it works</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-paper/10 px-5 py-5 text-xs text-paper/50 lg:px-10">© {year} Bauhu. All rights reserved.</div>
</footer>
